Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.20,0:00:57.11,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(242,426)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.12,0:01:00.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁点了蟹黄堡配辣珊瑚块
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.12,0:01:00.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who ordered the Krabby Patty and spicy coral bits?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.53,0:01:06.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  这地方快垮了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.53,0:01:06.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, this place is falling apart
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.65,0:01:08.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你得雇个人修理一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.65,0:01:08.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll have to hire someone to fix it
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.60,0:01:09.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,雇个人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.60,0:01:09.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hire someone?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.95,0:01:10.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要花钱是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.95,0:01:10.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,For money?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.33,0:01:13.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一般就是这么干的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.33,0:01:13.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's usually how it works
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.42,0:01:16.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我自己就能修
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.42,0:01:16.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can fix it meself
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.58,0:01:17.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用胶带
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.58,0:01:17.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with duct tape
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.13,0:01:25.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看吧  焕然一新
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.13,0:01:25.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look at that, good as new
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.56,0:01:26.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,胶带吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.56,0:01:26.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Duct tape?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.60,0:01:28.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你认真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.60,0:01:28.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.12,0:01:29.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.12,0:01:29.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.52,0:01:33.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我用胶带修蟹堡王所有东西好多年了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:31.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've been fixing everything in the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.15,0:01:33.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with duct tape for years
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.20,0:01:36.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看好  我来修好那边那张摇晃的桌子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.20,0:01:36.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Watch, I'll repair that wobbly table over there
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.97,0:01:41.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我变
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.97,0:01:41.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Presto
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.18,0:01:43.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,修好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.18,0:01:43.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fixed
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.52,0:01:46.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样根本没法吃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.52,0:01:46.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't eat like this
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.90,0:01:50.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还能解决客人的投诉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.90,0:01:50.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And it also solves customers' complaints
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.85,0:01:52.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我还用胶带修我的壳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.85,0:01:52.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, I even duct tape me shell
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.99,0:01:56.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁还有空蜕壳啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.99,0:01:56.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who has time for molting?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.11,0:01:59.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,胶带就没什么不能修的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.11,0:01:59.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's nothing duct tape can't fix
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.60,0:02:11.94,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(854,264)}菜单
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.38,0:02:17.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这地方胶带的含量比餐厅还多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.38,0:02:17.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This place is more duct tape than restaurant
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.55,0:02:18.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.55,0:02:18.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's fine
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.07,0:02:20.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上菜了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.07,0:02:20.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Order up
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.79,0:02:27.12,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1508,450)}调料岛
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.93,0:02:45.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  可能需要做点小小的维修工作
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.93,0:02:45.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, we may need to do some minor repair work
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.70,0:02:48.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过那些贵得要命的维修工我可不雇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.70,0:02:48.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But I'm not hiring any of those expensive repairmen
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.92,0:02:50.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们自己修
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.92,0:02:50.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We'll fix it ourselves
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.62,0:02:53.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别指望我帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.62,0:02:53.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't expect any help from me
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.07,0:02:56.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可不是为体力劳动而生的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.07,0:02:56.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not built for manual labor
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.87,0:02:59.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没问题  章鱼哥先生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.87,0:02:59.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No problem, Mr. Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.14,0:03:01.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你什么都不用修
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.14,0:03:01.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You won't have to fix a thing
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.93,0:03:04.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,因为整修期间照常营业
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.93,0:03:04.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Because we'll be open during construction
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.97,0:03:07.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你要一边接单一边做蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.97,0:03:07.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll be taking orders and cooking up patties
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.12,0:03:09.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要干嘛呢  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.12,0:03:09.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What am I going to do, Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.90,0:03:12.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你负责做我的得力海绵助手  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.90,0:03:12.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You'll be my right hand sponge, boy-o
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.33,0:03:16.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要怎么一边做蟹黄堡一边接单
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.33,0:03:13.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to cook
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.75,0:03:16.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and take orders at the same time?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.86,0:03:21.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.86,0:03:21.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh no
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.07,0:03:21.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我辞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.07,0:03:21.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I qui--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:30.85,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(544,624)}维修期间\N正常营业
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.18,0:03:34.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拿去吧  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.18,0:03:34.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here you go, boy-o
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.45,0:03:37.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你修地板  我修收银船
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.45,0:03:35.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You fix those floorboards
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.73,0:03:37.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,while I work on the register boat
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.60,0:03:42.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别怕  小地板
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.60,0:03:42.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, little floor
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.80,0:03:44.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我会轻点的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.80,0:03:44.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll be gentle
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.71,0:03:50.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.71,0:03:50.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the--
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.92,0:03:54.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临蟹堡王
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.92,0:03:54.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Krusty Krab
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.30,0:03:55.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可以
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.30,0:03:55.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,May I--
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.54,0:03:57.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可以为你点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.54,0:03:57.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,May I take your
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.55,0:03:59.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,餐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.55,0:03:59.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,order?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.43,0:04:01.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你能不能小点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.43,0:04:01.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you keep it--
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.65,0:04:04.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,声
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.65,0:04:04.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,down?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.96,0:04:08.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要来一打蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.96,0:04:08.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd like one dozen Krabby Patties, please
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.46,0:04:10.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,马上就来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.46,0:04:10.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Coming right up
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.79,0:04:17.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再来一颗钉子  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.79,0:04:17.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Another nail, boy-o
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.37,0:04:18.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,遵命  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.37,0:04:18.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aye aye, cap'n
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.82,0:04:22.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的餐来了  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.82,0:04:22.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your order, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.18,0:04:25.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,嗷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.18,0:04:25.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeowch
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.51,0:04:29.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我排在嗷前面的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.51,0:04:29.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was in line before Yeowch
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.04,0:04:32.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,记在嗷的账上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.04,0:04:32.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Put these on Yeowch's tab
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.73,0:04:40.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走路看路
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.73,0:04:40.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Watch where you're walking
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.35,0:04:42.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你把好端端的钉子都糟蹋了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.35,0:04:42.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're ruining perfectly good nails
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.70,0:04:57.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看看这里有什么要修的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.70,0:04:57.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's see what needs fixing in here
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.24,0:05:06.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以先修这个抽油烟机
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.24,0:05:06.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can start with this stove hood
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.37,0:05:06.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.37,0:05:06.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.00,0:05:10.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,堵了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.00,0:05:10.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,clogged
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.21,0:05:13.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  你负责抽油烟机
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.21,0:05:13.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, you handle the hood
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.00,0:05:15.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我把冰库凿开
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.00,0:05:15.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,while I chip out the freezer
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.86,0:05:21.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我一下子就可以马上修好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.86,0:05:21.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll have her fixed in two shakes of a barracuda's tail
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.00,0:05:25.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能行行好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.00,0:05:25.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do ya mind?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.82,0:05:27.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我当然又行又好啊  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.82,0:05:27.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh no, not at all, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.81,0:05:28.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢你关心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.81,0:05:28.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks for asking
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.32,0:05:34.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完美
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.32,0:05:34.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.08,0:05:38.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正适合扔进垃圾桶里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.08,0:05:38.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for the trash can
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.29,0:05:43.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.29,0:05:43.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hoo boy
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.27,0:05:45.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得搞到猴年马月
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.27,0:05:45.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is gonna take forever
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.25,0:05:52.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再狠狠砸一下子应该就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.25,0:05:52.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,One more good whack should do it
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.28,0:05:58.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别冲我脸来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.28,0:05:58.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not my face
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.50,0:06:00.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.50,0:06:00.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh no
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.95,0:06:03.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那些是承重蛤蜊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.95,0:06:03.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Those were load-bearing clams
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.02,0:06:12.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,救我出来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:12.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get me outta here
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.43,0:06:14.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,帮我一把  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.43,0:06:14.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lend me a claw, laddy
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.59,0:06:20.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.59,0:06:20.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:06:20.88,0:06:23.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你把它清理得干干净净
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:23.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You've cleaned it out wonderfully
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.30,0:06:25.80,标准-Chi,,0,900,0,,乐意帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.30,0:06:25.80,标准-Eng,,0,900,0,,Happy to help
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.75,0:06:38.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还算可以
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.75,0:06:38.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, not too bad
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.40,0:06:42.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  你把那个黏回去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.40,0:06:42.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, you glue that back together
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.64,0:06:43.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我修好这个裂缝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.64,0:06:43.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,while I fix this leak
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.95,0:06:46.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小菜一碟
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.95,0:06:46.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This'll be a cinch
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.42,0:06:53.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  马桶我都黏好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.42,0:06:53.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, I'm all finished with my commode gluing
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.23,0:06:57.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,行了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.23,0:06:57.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.50,0:07:03.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来搞定  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.50,0:07:03.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm on it, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.15,0:07:42.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看吧  章鱼哥先生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.15,0:07:42.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See, Mr. Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.80,0:07:46.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,根本用不着那些贵得要命的维修工
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.80,0:07:46.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We didn't need any of those fancy expensive repairmen
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.52,0:07:50.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不得不承认  看着还行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.52,0:07:50.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I have to admit, it actually looks okay
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.35,0:07:51.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,岂止还行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.35,0:07:51.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.97,0:07:54.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可壮观了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.97,0:07:54.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's glorious
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.67,0:07:59.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,除了那个烧坏的灯泡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.67,0:07:59.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Except for that burned out light bulb
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.35,0:08:01.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可以修
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.35,0:08:01.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can fix that
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.50,0:08:09.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,灯光燃尽  愿你一路走好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.50,0:08:09.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Lights out for you, little fella
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.06,0:08:25.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不能走过梯子底下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.06,0:08:25.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not walking under a ladder
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.87,0:08:27.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,会倒霉的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.87,0:08:27.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's bad luck
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.33,0:08:56.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,原来不用换啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.33,0:08:56.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess it didn't need to be changed after all
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.77,0:09:01.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊  你们两个活干得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.77,0:09:01.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, you two did a fantastic job
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.17,0:09:04.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然不想这么做  但也没得选了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.17,0:09:04.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to do this, but I'm out of options
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.02,0:09:07.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该出动L计划了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.02,0:09:07.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's time for plan L
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.41,0:09:09.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,L计划
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.41,0:09:09.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plan L?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.27,0:09:11.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你不会跳过了一两个字母吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.27,0:09:11.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Haven't you skipped a few letters?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.52,0:09:12.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,L计划
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.52,0:09:12.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plan L
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.00,0:09:15.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,龙虾拉里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.00,0:09:15.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Larry the Lobster
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.80,0:09:22.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拉里不确定自己为什么在这
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.80,0:09:22.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Larry's not sure why he's here
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.12,0:09:25.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王是用一个旧龙虾笼建的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.12,0:09:25.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Krusty Krab was built from an old lobster trap
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.31,0:09:28.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是时候该找个新的了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.31,0:09:28.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and it's time we found a new one
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.77,0:09:30.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你负责当诱饵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.77,0:09:30.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You are going to be the bait
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.67,0:09:33.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拉里就爱当诱饵
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.67,0:09:33.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Larry loves being bait
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.09,0:09:35.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样就能心跳加速
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.09,0:09:35.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It gets his heart pumping
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.14,0:09:45.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别省下那点融化的黄油
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.14,0:09:45.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't skimp on that melted butter
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.39,0:09:46.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这样没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.39,0:09:46.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This'll never work
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.21,0:09:51.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的钳子又大又美味
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.21,0:09:51.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My claws are big and tasty
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.95,0:09:55.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快看我丰满又多汁的尾巴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.95,0:09:55.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And check out my plump juicy tail
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.23,0:09:58.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.23,0:09:58.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.00,0:10:00.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一个龙虾笼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.00,0:10:00.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A lobster trap
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.62,0:10:05.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我有没有说  我还淋上了美味的黄油
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.62,0:10:05.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Did I happen to mention I'm covered in delicious butter?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:09.30,0:10:11.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,开干吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.30,0:10:11.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's rumble
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.84,0:10:28.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快啊  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.84,0:10:28.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:10:28.05,0:10:30.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它要逃到海面上去了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.05,0:10:30.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's making a break for the surface
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.07,0:10:39.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.07,0:10:39.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.75,0:10:42.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,刚刚的有氧运动太爽了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.75,0:10:42.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was some fantastic cardio
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.74,0:10:43.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.74,0:10:43.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Alright
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.84,0:10:45.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来把这宝贝带回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.84,0:10:45.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's get this puppy home
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.17,0:10:47.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用力拉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.17,0:10:47.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.79,0:10:49.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用力拉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.79,0:10:49.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.35,0:10:52.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.35,0:10:52.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Heave
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.97,0:10:53.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.97,0:10:53.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,ho
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.77,0:10:57.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,焕然一新
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.77,0:10:57.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Good as new
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.59,0:11:05.68,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1316,724)}盛大重新开张
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.40,0:11:08.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,裤头村请注意
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:08.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Attention Bikini Bottom
Dialogue: 1,0:11:08.32,0:11:12.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎前来蟹堡王的盛大重新开张活动
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.32,0:11:12.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Krusty Krab's grand reopening
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.80,0:11:21.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.80,0:11:21.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hold on
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.82,0:11:24.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要不来拿胶带修吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.82,0:11:24.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why don't you fix it with duct tape?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.52,0:11:25.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.52,0:11:25.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.18,0:11:26.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这边一点胶带
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.18,0:11:26.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Some duct tape here
Dialogue: 1,0:11:26.36,0:11:27.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这边一点胶带
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.36,0:11:27.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Some duct tape here
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.61,0:11:29.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要不这边一点胶带
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.61,0:11:29.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How about some duct tape here?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.04,0:11:29.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,胶带
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:29.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Duct tape
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.41,0:11:31.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,胶带
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.41,0:11:31.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Duct tape
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.63,0:11:37.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,胶带就没什么不能修的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.63,0:11:37.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There's nothing duct tape can't fix
