Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.94,0:11:55.69,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(964,798)}裤头村农贸市场
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.07,0:11:59.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家好  住地下室的阿宅们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.07,0:11:59.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Greetings, fellow basement dwellers
Dialogue: 1,0:11:59.36,0:12:03.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎收看新一期  下线走出门
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.36,0:12:03.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And welcome to another episode of Touching Grass
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:06.66,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(180,940)}直播
Dialogue: 1,0:12:03.61,0:12:06.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天我们来到了农贸市场门口
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.61,0:12:06.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Today, we're outside the farmers market
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.66,0:12:09.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里可谓是本地美食的大杂烩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:09.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a smorgasbord of local delicacies
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.79,0:12:13.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,齐聚一堂  方便快捷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.79,0:12:13.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,all in one convenient location
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.75,0:12:15.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最棒的是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.75,0:12:15.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Best of all
Dialogue: 1,0:12:15.33,0:12:19.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有免费试吃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.33,0:12:19.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,they give away free samples
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.00,0:12:20.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那边那位
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.00,0:12:20.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey there
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.30,0:12:22.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要来尝尝拉里独家专利的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.30,0:12:22.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Care to try Larry's patented
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.63,0:12:24.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蛋白兄弟奶昔吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.63,0:12:24.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"bro-tein" shake?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.72,0:12:26.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊  谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.72,0:12:26.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why yes, thank you
Dialogue: 1,0:12:31.73,0:12:32.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你好  搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.73,0:12:32.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Howdy, partner
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.89,0:12:34.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要来免费试吃一份
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.89,0:12:34.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you like a free sample
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.35,0:12:36.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的德克萨斯烤肉甜甜圈吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.35,0:12:36.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of one of my Texas Barbecue Donuts?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:39.65,0:12:42.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一说免费试吃我就想尝了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.65,0:12:42.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You had me at "free sample"
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.21,0:12:56.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要去哪找下一口美食呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.21,0:12:56.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now, where to find our next morsel?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.75,0:12:58.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,辣酱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.75,0:12:58.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hot sauce?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.55,0:13:04.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.55,0:13:04.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No thanks
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.22,0:13:06.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,漫画
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.22,0:13:06.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Caricatures?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.72,0:13:09.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.72,0:13:09.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Negatory
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.68,0:13:12.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,接吻摊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.68,0:13:12.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Kissing booth?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.69,0:13:15.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.69,0:13:15.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gross
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.65,0:13:19.82,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1258,826)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:13:17.65,0:13:19.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹堡王摊位
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.65,0:13:19.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The Krusty Krab booth
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.15,0:13:25.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要免费试吃一份蟹黄堡  不加奶酪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.15,0:13:25.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll have one free sample of a Krabby Patty, no cheese
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.95,0:13:27.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,免费试喝一份蟹堡奶昔
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.95,0:13:27.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,one free sample of a Krusty Shake
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.82,0:13:30.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,免费试吃三份珊瑚薯条
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.82,0:13:30.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,three free samples of coral fries
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.91,0:13:33.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我把我停车场租给这些怪人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.91,0:13:33.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I didn't rent out me parking lot to all these weirdos
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.91,0:13:36.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可不是为了把钱亏在免费试吃品上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.91,0:13:36.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,just to lose money on free samples
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.71,0:13:40.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们这里只卖蟹堡王吐司三明治
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.71,0:13:40.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're only selling Krusty Toast Sandwiches here
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.50,0:13:43.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,用最高档的不新鲜汉堡面包做的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.50,0:13:43.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Made from the finest stale patty buns
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.26,0:13:46.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.26,0:13:46.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Fine
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.47,0:13:47.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来一份
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.47,0:13:47.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll take one
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.82,0:14:04.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好干啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.82,0:14:04.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's so dry
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.07,0:14:07.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.07,0:14:07.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I like it too
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.70,0:14:19.25,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1444,856)}娜琳诺比果酱
Dialogue: 1,0:14:10.20,0:14:14.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快来尝尝我们超级好吃的果酱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.20,0:14:14.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Step right up and try our jim-dandy jams
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.33,0:14:17.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,滋味好到能惊掉我们的袜子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.33,0:14:17.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,These flavors would even knock our socks off
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.58,0:14:19.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,前提是我们有穿袜子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.58,0:14:19.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,if'n we ever wore 'em
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.13,0:14:22.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,果酱特好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.13,0:14:22.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Them's good jams
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.59,0:14:29.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没事  痞妈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.59,0:14:29.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm okay, Ma
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.89,0:14:31.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,该死的独角鲸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.89,0:14:31.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Darn Narwhals
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.72,0:14:32.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.72,0:14:32.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sheldon
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.93,0:14:36.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给他们尝尝浮游生物祖传美食
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.93,0:14:36.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Give 'em a little of that Plankton family charm
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:38.31,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(338,798)}浮游生物家族\N海花生酱
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.85,0:14:42.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们居然把我拉了进来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.85,0:14:42.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you dragged me into this
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.73,0:14:45.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走过路过  不要错过
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.73,0:14:45.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come one, come all
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.69,0:14:48.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,尝尝浮游生物家族祖传秘方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.69,0:14:48.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Try an old Plankton family recipe
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.74,0:14:50.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,乡村风味花生酱
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.74,0:14:50.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,country-style nut butter
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.62,0:14:55.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吃到能让你触角都卷起来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.62,0:14:55.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tastes so good, your antennae will be in a twist
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.87,0:14:58.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可恶的浮游生物
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.87,0:14:58.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No-good Planktons
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.13,0:15:11.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,世仇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.13,0:15:11.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Feud
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.66,0:15:32.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.66,0:15:32.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh no
Dialogue: 1,0:15:32.82,0:15:34.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.82,0:15:34.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.07,0:15:36.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,害你的吐司三明治毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.07,0:15:36.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,your toast sandwich is ruined
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.74,0:15:39.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不对  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.74,0:15:39.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.62,0:15:43.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不如说是  没被毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.62,0:15:43.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If anything, it has been un-ruined
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.46,0:15:46.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,注意了  各位吃货
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.46,0:15:46.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Attention, foodie fans
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.50,0:15:47.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我宣布这个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.50,0:15:47.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I declare this
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.38,0:15:50.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加了海花生酱跟果酱的吐司三明治是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.38,0:15:50.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,toast sandwich with sea-nut butter and jam to be
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.92,0:15:53.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,传奇美味
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.92,0:15:53.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a taste sensation
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.30,0:15:56.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定要尝尝看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.30,0:15:56.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You must try it
Dialogue: 1,0:15:57.39,0:15:58.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要再来七份
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.39,0:15:58.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll take seven more
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.64,0:16:00.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他居然喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.64,0:16:00.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He likes it?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.31,0:16:04.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,独角鲸食物跟浮游生物食物
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.31,0:16:04.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Narwhal food and Plankton food
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.65,0:16:05.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,会有这么搭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.65,0:16:05.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,go together?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.03,0:16:11.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们都是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.03,0:16:11.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're all
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.95,0:16:13.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,摊友了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.95,0:16:13.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,booth buddies
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.20,0:16:21.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来我们能搁下两家的世仇了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.20,0:16:19.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I suppose we can put our families'
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:21.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,long-runnin' feud aside
Dialogue: 1,0:16:21.91,0:16:22.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,暂时是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.91,0:16:22.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,For now
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.79,0:16:24.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,随便
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.79,0:16:24.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Whatever
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.30,0:16:30.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走过路过  不要错过
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:30.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come one, come all
Dialogue: 1,0:16:31.22,0:16:34.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加入裤头村最新的美食狂潮吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.22,0:16:34.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Join Bikini Bottom's newest feeding frenzy
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.09,0:16:38.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来买好吃到呱呱叫的三明治
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.09,0:16:38.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Get yourself a Holler Hoagie
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.43,0:16:41.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,从南部乡村直接送到你嘴里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.43,0:16:41.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,From the Deep South to your mouth
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.23,0:16:46.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最新消息
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.23,0:16:46.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This just in
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.81,0:16:48.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请给我来一份三明治
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.81,0:16:48.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd like one sandwich, please
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.73,0:16:49.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,马上就来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.73,0:16:49.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Coming right up
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.61,0:16:53.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没看到有人排队吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.61,0:16:53.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can't you see there's a line?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.79,0:17:03.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吐司做好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.79,0:17:03.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Toast is ready
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.41,0:17:05.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,面包可以拿来吗  宝贝们
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.41,0:17:05.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can I get those buns, hons?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.34,0:17:10.09,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我本来要用那个的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.34,0:17:10.09,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was gonna use that
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.05,0:17:12.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:12.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why, you
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.59,0:17:16.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们都是同一队的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.59,0:17:16.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're all on the same team
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.97,0:17:18.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.97,0:17:18.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yup, that's right
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.26,0:17:20.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们要合作
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.26,0:17:20.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We gotta work together
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.56,0:17:27.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,走路看路
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.56,0:17:27.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Watch where you're walkin'
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.90,0:17:29.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这小不点白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.90,0:17:29.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you eensy idgit
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.77,0:17:32.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,坐地看地
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.77,0:17:32.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, watch where you're sittin'
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.65,0:17:34.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这长鼻子怪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.65,0:17:34.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you nose-sharpener
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.61,0:17:39.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我没事  痞妈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.61,0:17:39.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm okay, Ma
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.75,0:17:47.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,忘了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.75,0:17:47.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.75,0:17:50.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只有团结才能实现三明治梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.75,0:17:50.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Teamwork makes the sandwich dream work
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.79,0:17:54.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我梦想中的三明治就是让她吃我一拳
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.79,0:17:54.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The only sandwich I'm dreamin' of is a knuckle sandwich
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.47,0:18:00.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我应该有办法解决
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.47,0:18:00.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think I have a solution
